      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Organizations in the app (2026-11-16, B6b, server 0.6.0): invites show on Home and in Settings &gt; Account</li><li>Who sees a call, private calls (2026-11-16, B6b): the call page and the Meeting Sheet say &quot;Visible to your team</li><li>Move a project (2026-11-16): a project&#x27;s page moves it with its calls to another of your organizations or back</li><li>Organization projects (2026-11-16, D38, Enterprise): a project&#x27;s page links it to an organization project you</li><li>Colleagues&#x27; changes to decisions, tasks and risks survive the next sync (2026-11-16, D40, server 0.7.0): every</li><li>Colleagues&#x27; changes come back to your Mac (2026-11-16, D40, server 0.7.0): when someone on the same organization</li><li>Shared organization project card (2026-11-16, D40, server 0.7.0): a project linked to an organization project</li><li>Colleagues&#x27; decisions, tasks and risks in the Tracker (2026-11-16, D40, server 0.7.0): for a project linked to</li><li>Set up an organization (2026-11-16, D39): after the upgrade the owner gets &quot;Acme is ready. Set it up&quot; on Home</li><li>New project (2026-11-16, D39): Settings &gt; Projects &gt; Add &gt; New project... is a short window: the name and</li><li>Sample project (2026-11-16, D39): the first start makes a &quot;Sample project&quot; with a made-up client, three people,</li><li>Small fixes (2026-11-16, organizations smoke test): the Join window&#x27;s own button no longer has &quot;...&quot;; coming back</li></ul>]]></description>
